UI (USER INTERFACE ) is the visual part of a website or application that users interact with. 
It includes buttons, menus, icons, colors and layouts.
A good UI focuses on clarity, consistency, attractiveness, making digital
and visuial  products easy to navigate, visually appealing, and efficient for users to accomplish tasks.
Caption-Where creativity meets functionality

UX (USER EXPERIENCE)
UX focuses on creating a seamless interaction between users and the website or application. 
It emphasizes Easy to use navigation, responsive design, visual consistency, accessibility, 
and fast performance to ensure users can easily achieve their goals while enjoying a smooth and satisfying experience.
Caption-Simplifying user journeys with thoughtful and efficient interfaces

React is a popular JavaScript library used for building fast and interactive user interfaces, especially for single-page applications. 
It follows a component-based architecture, allowing developers to create reusable UI elements. 
React improves performance through the Virtual DOM and makes frontend development more efficient, scalable, and easy to maintain.
Caption-Building dynamic and reusable user interfaces with ease
